 etc, but on any scenes formerly with Paths they aren't visible.\n\nStrangely if i add a fresh path3D node to a scene with the invisible paths, and copy and paste the curve resource from Path3DA into Path3DB, it becomes visible again. But clearing and copying the curve back from Path3DB to Path3DA, it goes back to being invisible. It's like some aspect of the former Path3D node is changed/corrupted that is not present in freshly added ones in Path3D from 4.5b3 brought into 4.5b4.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3136926012/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3137450819","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109033#issuecomment-3137450819","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109033","id":3137450819,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67AbND","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/rec